{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the scientist manage the routine tasks of an indoor farm in a cold, lonely world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you can keep the farm running and maybe do a little bit of good for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What more is there to do? We feed millions of people across the world. And if this place is still standing in a few months, it might just end up feeding the entire world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I guess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You guess?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It\u2019s just like...why did we build all this, if we\u2019re just going to use it to survive another day?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and atmospheric linear visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contemplation in a post-apocalyptic setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold and expressive pixel art</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159880?t=1748912425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159880?t=1748912425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159880/966055a35a9c83525c52f9c77f97e54ce7f126c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748912425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159880/966055a35a9c83525c52f9c77f97e54ce7f126c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748912425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the scientist man